        "text": "Wins\n — \n5/12/22, 4:01 AM\nThursday, May 12, 2022 at 4:01 AM\nBrief history of Daisy Hills R and the video of the 1:20.21 run. I hope someone can get 1:19 using this. \n\nhttps://twitter.com/winsmkt/status/1524704987812667395?s=21\nMKT Wins (@WinsMkt)\n(1/3) I started playing TA more than 2 years ago in Daisy Hills R. Back then I could barely get a 1:22. One day out of nowhere @tomegome_g found a completely new strategy to NISC the famous ramp turn. It was mindblowing..  and is still today’s standard route used in mogis!\nTwitter•5/12/22, 3:56 AM\n3\nAdd Reaction",
